@startuml 方案A同步提交时序
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DCE9FB
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontColor #1F2933
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteFontColor #5C4A00

title 方案 A：内网 Claude 提交 SSH 命令 → 外网 Worker 执行 → 同步回传

participant "Claude Code\n(内网)" as CC
participant "MCP Server\n(内网, stdio)" as TOOL
participant "HGFS 队列\n(pending/...)" as Q
participant "Node Worker\n(Windows)" as W
participant "设备 A\n(外网 SSH)" as D

== 阶段一：内网提交任务 ==

CC -> TOOL : 调用 submit_ssh_task(cmd, timeout_sec)
TOOL -> Q : 检查 task_id 幂等
note over TOOL, Q : pending/processing 已存在同 id 则拒绝重提
TOOL -> Q : 读 heartbeat.json 判断 Worker 在线
TOOL -> Q : 写 .tmp → rename pending/<task_id>.json

== 阶段二：外网消费并抢占 ==

W -> Q : 轮询 pending (500ms 退避)
W -> Q : 创建 processing/<task_id>.lock 抢占
note over W, Q : O_CREAT|O_EXCL，创建成功者拥有执行权
W -> Q : 二次确认 processing 无同 id 文件

== 阶段三：安全校验与执行 ==

W -> W : 命令白/黑名单 + 参数校验
alt 校验通过
  W -> D : SSH 执行命令
  D --> W : stdout / stderr / exit_code
  alt 输出超过 64KB
    W -> Q : 落盘 outputs/<task_id>.stdout
    note over W, Q : 结构体只保留摘要 + 指针
  end
else 校验失败
  W -> Q : 写 failed，error_msg=blocked_by_policy
end

== 阶段四：结果回写与消费 ==

W -> Q : 回写 completed / failed
TOOL -> Q : 阻塞轮询结果目录 (指数退避)
TOOL --> CC : 返回 stdout/stderr/exit_code
note over TOOL, Q : truncated=true 则按指针读 outputs/ 大文件

== 阶段五：超时取消兜底 ==

alt 30s 内未出结果
  TOOL -> Q : 超时写 cancelled/<task_id>
  W -> Q : 回写前检查 cancelled/
  note over W, Q : 已取消则写 cancelled/<task_id>.result(审计)，不污染 completed
end

== 阶段六：心跳保活 ==

W -> Q : 每 5s 写 heartbeat.json
TOOL -> Q : 提交前读心跳
note over TOOL, Q : now - last_beat > 15s 则返回 worker_offline，不提交

@enduml
